{"ts": "2026-11-04T15:29:32.012912+07:00", "session_id": "v2diag-d008", "turn_index": 0, "input_mode": "text", "question": "Bedanya Teknik Informatika sama Teknologi Informasi apa?", "retrieved": [{"chunk_id": "brosur/brosur-pmb-2025#4", "score": 0.03225806451612903, "ranks": {"bm25": 2, "dense": 2}}, {"chunk_id": "brosur/brosur-pmb-2025#6", "score": 0.032018442622950824, "ranks": {"bm25": 4, "dense": 1}}, {"chunk_id": "akademik/peraturan-akademik-2025#79", "score": 0.031544957774465976, "ranks": {"bm25": 1, "dense": 6}}, {"chunk_id": "pmb/pedoman-pmb-2027#14", "score": 0.03125763125763126, "ranks": {"bm25": 3, "dense": 5}}, {"chunk_id": "brosur/brosur-pmb-2025#5", "score": 0.03055037313432836, "ranks": {"bm25": 7, "dense": 4}}], "gate": {"passed": true, "score": 0.5833039283752441, "threshold": 0.5}, "llm_provider": "groq:openai/gpt-oss-120b", "llm_status": "answered", "final_status": "answered", "answer": "Teknik Informatika (Computer Science) fokus pada pengembangan perangkat lunak berskala besar dan berbasis AI, dengan keahlian di AI‑based Software Development serta Scalable Software Development. Teknologi Informasi (Information Technology) menekankan keamanan siber, analisis data besar, dan transformasi digital, dengan keahlian di Cyber Security dan Big Data Analytics. Jadi, TI lebih ke infrastruktur, keamanan, dan data, sementara TI‑Informatika lebih ke pemrograman dan algoritma.", "sources": ["brosur/brosur-pmb-2025#4", "brosur/brosur-pmb-2025#6"], "fact_check": {"passed": true, "checked": 0, "unsupported": []}, "timings": {"scrub": 4.820000322069973e-05, "retrieval": 0.2688348000010592, "gate": 1.599999814061448e-05, "llm": 1.0907510999968508, "check": 0.0006817000030423515, "total": 1.3603375000020606}, "kb_id": "official-2026-10-24-v5", "config_hash": "073e446b98798e5b4d731873339f259f4910aa02971fefa14066b69b7b871fd2", "app_version": "0.1.0", "llm_usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2258, "completion_tokens": 190, "total_tokens": 2448}, "citations": ["brosur/brosur-pmb-2025#4", "brosur/brosur-pmb-2025#6"], "error_code": null, "prompt_version": "v5"}
