{"ts": "2026-11-04T15:34:34.191051+07:00", "session_id": "v2diag-d033", "turn_index": 1, "input_mode": "text", "question": "Kalau yang Magister TI syaratnya apa?", "retrieved": [{"chunk_id": "pmb/pedoman-pmb-2027#14", "score": 0.03278688524590164, "ranks": {"bm25": 2, "dense": 1}}, {"chunk_id": "brosur/brosur-pmb-2025#8", "score": 0.031754032258064516, "ranks": {"bm25": 9, "dense": 5}}, {"chunk_id": "pmb/pedoman-pmb-2027#13", "score": 0.0315136476426799, "ranks": {"bm25": 7, "dense": 2}}, {"chunk_id": "akademik/peraturan-akademik-2025#81", "score": 0.03057889822595705, "ranks": {"bm25": 5, "dense": 6}}, {"chunk_id": "akademik/peraturan-akademik-2025#72", "score": 0.02967032967032967, "ranks": {"bm25": 6, "dense": 8}}], "gate": {"passed": true, "score": 0.7363672256469727, "threshold": 0.5}, "llm_provider": "groq:openai/gpt-oss-120b", "llm_status": "answered", "final_status": "answered", "answer": "Untuk masuk Magister Teknologi Informasi (S2), calon mahasiswa harus lulusan sarjana dengan latar belakang ilmu komputer, teknik, ekonomi, MIPA, atau bidang lain yang disertai pengalaman kerja di bidang TI minimal tiga tahun. Selain itu, IPK sarjana minimal 2,75 dan skor TOEFL minimal 475 diperlukan.", "sources": ["pmb/pedoman-pmb-2027#14"], "fact_check": {"passed": true, "checked": 2, "unsupported": []}, "timings": {"scrub": 3.0000002880115062e-05, "retrieval": 0.14891050000005635, "gate": 1.049999991664663e-05, "llm": 0.9204229000024498, "check": 0.0013470999983837828, "total": 1.070723500000895}, "kb_id": "official-2026-10-24-v5", "config_hash": "073e446b98798e5b4d731873339f259f4910aa02971fefa14066b69b7b871fd2", "app_version": "0.1.0", "llm_usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2367, "completion_tokens": 151, "total_tokens": 2518}, "citations": ["pmb/pedoman-pmb-2027#14"], "error_code": null, "prompt_version": "v5"}
